se</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">12</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// => throws ZodError</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// \"safe\" parsing (doesn't throw error if validation fails)</span>\nmySchema<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">safeParse</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tuna\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// => { success: true; data: \"tuna\" }</span>\nmySchema<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">safeParse</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">12</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// => { success: false; error: ZodError }</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n          <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button-container\">\n            <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"gatsbyRemarkCopyToClipboard(this, this.parentNode.nextElementSibling)\">\n              Copy\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"tsx\"><pre class=\"language-tsx\"><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> z <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"zod\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> User <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> z<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">object</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    username<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> z<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\nUser<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">parse</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> username<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Ludwig\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// extract the inferred type</span>\n<span class=\"token class-name\"><span class=\"token keyword\">type</span></span> User <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> z<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>infer<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token keyword\">typeof</span> User<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// { username: string }</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>Ref</strong> <a href=\"https://zod.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://zod.dev/</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"jest-tobecloseto\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#jest-tobecloseto\" aria-label=\"jest tobecloseto permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>jest <code class=\"language-text\">toBeCloseTo</code></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://jestjs.io/docs/expect#tobeclosetonumber-numdigits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://jestjs.io/docs/expect#tobeclosetonumber-numdigits</a></li>\n<li>소수점 지정자리까지만 같으면 같은 값으로 쳐준다</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"usepreservedcallback\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#usepreservedcallback\" aria-label=\"usepreservedcallback permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">usePreservedCallback</code></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://react-simplikit.slash.page/hooks/usePreservedCallback.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://react-simplikit.slash.page/hooks/usePreservedCallback.html</a></li>\n<li>ref를 사용해 최신값을 반영하면서도 리렌더링에도 바뀌지 않는 콜백 함수의 참조를 유지하는 방법</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"타입스크립트-pick-vs-extract--omit-vs-exclude\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%83%80%EC%9E%85%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%BD%ED%8A%B8-pick-vs-extract--omit-vs-exclude\" aria-label=\"타입스크립트 pick vs extract  omit vs exclude permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>타입스크립트 Pick vs Extract / Omit vs Exclude</h3>\n<p><strong>객체 타입에 사용하는 유틸리티</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">Pick&lt;T, K></code>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>정의</strong>: 타입 <code class=\"language-text\">T</code>에서 <code class=\"language-text\">K</code>에 해당하는 키만 골라 새로운 타입을 만든다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>예시</strong>:</p>\n\n          <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button-container\">\n            <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"gatsbyRemarkCopyToClipboard(this, this.parentNode.nextElementSibling)\">\n              Copy\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"tsx\"><pre class=\"language-tsx\"><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    id<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    email<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">UserName</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Pick<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>User<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'name'</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// => { name: string }</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">Omit&lt;T, K></code>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>정의</strong>: 타입 <code class=\"language-text\">T</code>에서 <code class=\"language-text\">K</code>에 해당하는 키를 제거한 새로운 타입을 만든다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>예시</strong>:</p>\n\n          <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button-container\">\n            <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"gatsbyRemarkCopyToClipboard(this, this.parentNode.nextElementSibling)\">\n              Copy\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"tsx\"><pre class=\"language-tsx\"><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">UserWithoutEmail</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Omit<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>User<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'email'</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// => { id: number; name: string }</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>유니언 타입에 사용하는 유틸리티</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">Extract&lt;T, U></code>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>정의</strong>: 유니언 타입 <code class=\"language-text\">T</code>에서 <code class=\"language-text\">U</code>에 해당하는 타입만 남긴다 (공통된 타입만 유지).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>예시</strong>:</p>\n\n          <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button-container\">\n            <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"gatsbyRemarkCopyToClipboard(this, this.parentNode.nextElementSibling)\">\n              Copy\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"tsx\"><pre class=\"language-tsx\"><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"token class-name\"><span class=\"token constant\">A</span></span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'a'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token string\">'b'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token string\">'c'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"token class-name\"><span class=\"token constant\">B</span></span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'a'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token string\">'z'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Result</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Extract<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token constant\">A</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token constant\">B</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// => 'a'</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">Exclude&lt;T, U></code>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>정의</strong>: 유니언 타입 <code class=\"language-text\">T</code>에서 <code class=\"language-text\">U</code>에 해당하는 타입을 제거한다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>예시</strong>:</p>\n\n          <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button-container\">\n            <div class=\"gatsby-remark-prismjs-copy-button\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"gatsbyRemarkCopyToClipboard(this, this.parentNode.nextElementSibling)\">\n              Copy\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"tsx\"><pre class=\"language-tsx\"><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"token class-name\"><span class=\"token constant\">A</span></span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'a'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token string\">'b'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token string\">'c'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Result</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Exclude<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token constant\">A</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'b'</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// => 'a' | 'c'</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"usevisibilityevent\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#usevisibilityevent\" aria-label=\"usevisibilityevent permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>useVisibilityEvent</h3>\n<p>페이지 한번 나갔다가 다시 들어왔을때 사용</p>\n<p><strong>Ref</strong> <a href=\"https://www.slash.page/ko/libraries/react/react/src/hooks/useVisibilityEvent.i18n\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://www.slash.page/ko/libraries/react/react/src/hooks/useVisibilityEvent.i18n</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"애플-앱-심사-가이드라인\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%95%A0%ED%94%8C-%EC%95%B1-%EC%8B%AC%EC%82%AC-%EA%B0%80%EC%9D%B4%EB%93%9C%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B8\" aria-label=\"애플 앱 심사 가이드라인 permalink